  "description": "Seong-Un Choi is the top-ranked player in the game \"Lost World,\" being the only player to have completed all its achievements. However, his triumph is short-lived as a mysterious message transports him to the real \"Lost World,\" transforming him from a mere gamer to a contender for godhood. Amidst others vying for divinity, will Seong-Un be able to achieve true godhood and reign supreme in this new realm?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
